"""Prepare Android-side Hammerhead compatibility files for Waydroid.

No Android image is modified.  Open payload files are supplied by this RPM.
Proprietary Qualcomm files are derived from the locally installed Hammerhead
adaptation and from a user-supplied, checksum-pinned LineageOS graphics archive.
Generated files are bind-mounted by config_android.
"""

